    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραπεζ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>at, of a table,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες τραπεζῆες</span>
			dogs <i>fed from their master's table,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.309
			</span></i>:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραπεζῆται</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				Ibyc.
				60
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραπεζίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>parasite,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.50c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἅιδου τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristias
				</span></i>
			 Trag.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
